                      info@elpescaito.com
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div><div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
                Cómo Llegar
              </h3><div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                  <i class="ri-subway-line text-blue-600"></i><span
                    class="text-gray-700"
                    >Metro: Línea 1, parada Centro Histórico</span>
                </div><div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                  <i class="ri-bus-line text-blue-600"></i><span
                    class="text-gray-700"
                    >Autobús: Líneas 1, 3, 11 - Parada Plaza de la Marina</span>
                </div><div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                  <i class="ri-car-line text-blue-600"></i><span
                    class="text-gray-700"
                    >Parking público a 100m en Calle Larios</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div><div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
            <iframe
              src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3198.0!2d-4.4214!3d36.7213!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0x0!2zMzbCsDQzJzE2LjciTiA0wrAyNScxNy4wIlc!5e0!3m2!1ses!2ses!4v1234567890"
              width="100%"
              height="400"
              allowfullscreen=""
              loading="lazy"
              referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
              title="Ubicación Marisquería El Pescaíto"
              style="border: 0px;"></iframe>
          </div>
        </div><div class="text-center mt-12">
          <button
            class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"
            >Reservar Mesa Ahora</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section><footer class="bg-gray-800 text-white py-12">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 mb-4">
              <div
                class="w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <i class="ri-restaurant-line text-white"></i>
              </div><h3
                class="text-xl font-bold"
                style="font-family: Pacifico, serif;"
              >
                El Pescaíto
              </h3>
            </div><p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
              Auténtica marisquería malagueña desde 1985. Pescado fresco,
              tradición y sabor en cada plato.
            </p><div class="flex space-x-4">
              <a
                href="#"
                class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
